{{Evolved_Card_Infobox|Cost=3|CycleCost=2|Rarity=Rare|Arena=Jungle Arena|Type=Troop|ReleaseDate=6 January 2025}}
{{Quote|It's time to blow darts and chew gum, and he's all out of gum. Evolved Dart Goblin's dart Poison the area around his target until they're destroyed. The more he attacks a target, the deadlier the Poison gets.}}

The Dart Goblin Evolution is a {{Rarity|Rare}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked with 6 Evolution shards. It spawns a Dart Goblin with identical stats to the original. When attacking a target, he will leave an area of effect poison, becoming stronger after multiple attacks. He resembles a [[Goblins|Goblin]], but wears a voodoo mask with purple eyes, team-colored face paint and a rope behind, leaves with circles and purple tips, and a [[Card Evolution]] symbol on top, purple pants, team-colored bands on his arm, and brown shoes, carries a purple potion, and holds a blowgun with purple paint. The Dart Goblin's Evolution costs 3 [[Elixir]] and requires 2 cycles to deploy.

==Strategy==
*Even if the Evolved Dart Goblin is defeated, the poison will stay until that unit is defeated. So shooting high-hitpoint units like the [[Golem]], [[Giant]], [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Electro Giant]], [[Mega Knight]], [[Goblin Giant]], [[Royal Giant]], or [[Lava Hound]] will make sure that a lot of poison will be made for a long time.
*Against Crown Towers, the poison will only remain for 1 second, and he will only deal 25% of its damage.
*Troops that spawn other troops after death will not carry over the poison to their sub troops if the parent troop is poisoned.
*The poison effect does not stack. For example, if two Evolved Dart Goblins attack the same troop, the second one will not increase the poison damage of the first one. Instead, both poison effects will affect the troop individually.

