==History==
2025
*The Dart Goblin's Evolution card was added to the game on 6/1/2025, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/1/2025)|January 2025 Update]].
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Dart Goblin's damage by 5%.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Dart Goblin's hitpoints by 0.38%, and decreased his damage by 1.48%.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Evolved Dart Goblin's Damage by 17%, increased his attack time interval to 0.8 seconds (from 0.7 seconds), and decreased the Poison's Duration to 1 second (from 4 seconds).
2026

* On 12/1/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the dart goblins damage by 8%.
* On 2/3/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Dart Goblin's sight range to 7.5 tiles (from 7 tiles).
* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Stage 1 poison damage by 25% and Stage 2's damage by 11%

